{"id":"zuschauer","lemma":"Zuschauer","pos":"noun","rank":2722,"glosses":["spectator","viewer","audience"],"ipa":"/ˈt͡suːˌʃaʊ̯ɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a3/De-Zuschauer.ogg/De-Zuschauer.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Zuschauers","plural":"Zuschauer","feminine":"Zuschauerin"},"examples":[{"text":"Die Zuschauer kommen.","en":"The spectators are arriving.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to come"}]},{"text":"Es kamen mehr Zuschauer, als ich erwartet hatte.","en":"There were more spectators than I had expected.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"expected, anticipated"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Einige der Zuschauer waren Kanadier.","en":"Some of the audience were Canadians.","words":[{"g":"united","l":"einig"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"Canadian"}]},{"text":"Er konnte nicht sprechen, weil die Zuschauer so laut waren.","en":"He couldn't speak because the audience was too noisy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/790545","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to speak"},{"g":"because, given that"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"so"},{"g":"according to"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich bin nur ein unbeteiligter Zuschauer.","en":"I'm just an innocent bystander.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"a"},null,null]}]}